  "contract": [
    "An existing shared authority keeps its accepted catalog during replica startup. Missing retained inputs prevent the initial lease request and shared publication.",
    "A read-only replica needs no provider bindings to serve accepted state. Matching inputs allow initial ownership without replacing the generation.",
    "Explicit refresh still requires matching inputs before ownership. The lease keeper supports delayed initial acquisition and retains fencing and close-race behavior."
  ],
