  "limitations": [
    "The origin cases use an in-memory catalog store and a stub lease. They do not prove shared backend recovery, equivalent acquisition capabilities, or atomic lease/head fencing. CSP11 retains that scope.",
    "Explicit authority transitions, native parent integration, full delivery checks, required review, publication, and merge remain open.",
    "The last source change after race verification only clarifies the leaseLost comment. No executable Go statement changed."
  ],
